   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「驚きだわ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「子羊ちゃんたら、いつから私の許可も無しに口を開くようになったのかしら？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そうよ子羊ちゃん♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「それはこっちのセリフだけど」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「子羊ちゃんが喋っていいのは、私が許可した時だけよ。教えたでしょ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「今日はよっぽど遊んで欲しいみたいね」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でも嬉しい。それってこれを求めてくれるってことだものね」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「お望み通り、今日は沢山遊んで、あ・げ・る」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あなたは私の下僕なの。忘れちゃったかしら？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ずっと昔から。そして、これから先もずっと」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:205900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「忘れちゃったの？ 悲しい……」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「でも大丈夫。思いださせてあげるから」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ううん、ちょっと違うかな」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「思いだすまで、遊んであげる」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「うふふふふふふふふふふふ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206400",
