  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:206900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「……宮代、先輩」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「『なんの為に』なんて、決まってるじゃん」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「誰もいない場所で、男の子と女の子がすることなんて、ひとつだけだよ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「え・っ・ち・な・こ・と♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「んふ。顔赤くなった。かわいい♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「宮代先輩ひどいんだもん。あんなにあたしがアプローチしたのに、全然気付いてくれないし」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「だから直接手段に訴えることにしたの。既成事実ってやつ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あー、まだ分かってないんだ！ ショックだなー」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ほら、これならどう？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「どう？ 思いだした？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:207900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あったりまえじゃーん！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「どこからどう見てもあたしっしょー！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ここまでしないとわかってくれない宮代先輩の方があたし的には驚きだよー！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「もー、なんでよー！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ひどーい。宮代先輩的には、あたしって性的対象に入ってないわけー？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ま、別にいいけどー。だからここに呼びだしたわけだし」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「宮代先輩に、あたしの魅力を知ってもらうの」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「うーん、ちょっと違うか。知ってもらうんじゃなくて、⟦rb⟧味わって⟦rt⟧⟦rbc⟧●●●●⟦/r⟧⟦rb⟧もらう⟦rt⟧⟦rbc⟧●●●⟦/r⟧の」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「そ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「美味しいよ？ あたしのか・ら・だ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:208900",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あはは！ 宮代先輩かわいいー！」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209000",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「じゃあ、はじめよっか」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209100",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「服着たままじゃヤりにくいでしょ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209200",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「あ、それとも宮代先輩って着たままヤりたいタイプ？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209300",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「え、それ女の子に聞く？ それとも言わせたいの？ 言葉責め？」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209400",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「頭で考えてちゃだめだよ。もっと本能で動いている宮代先輩が見たいなー」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209500",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「ほら、いいからさ、触ってよ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209600",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「もう、やっぱり言わせたいんだ。えっちだなあ」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209700",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「おっぱいだよ♪」"
  },
  {
   "id": "clse07:209800",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "香月華",
   "speaker_ko": "카즈키 하나",
   "prev_speaker": null,
   "next_speaker": null,
   "jp": "「服の上から触った後で、生で揉ませてあげるからね」"
  },
